@startuml Component_Diagram_Sprint_3
' Edison UPM - Component diagram updated with the Metrics component (Sprint 3, task 3.1.6, US 3.1)
' Changes vs Sprint 2:
'  - NEW Metrics component: records idea views and contact clicks, serves the founder's dashboard
'  - Sprint 2 as implemented: matchmaking was built inside Ideas (GET /api/ideas?tag=...&stage=...,
'    ranked by matching tags), so the separate Matchmaking component of the Sprint 2 design is removed.
'    Contact is the free-text field ideas.contact, also inside Ideas.
' ELK layout: orthogonal routing where each arrow gets its own track (no overlapping lines)
!pragma layout elk
title Edison UPM - Component Diagram (Sprint 3: Metrics)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F1F1F1
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam component<<new>> {
  BackgroundColor #FFF4D6
  BorderColor #B8860B
}
skinparam component<<Sprint 2>> {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FB
  BorderColor #4A6FA5
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #333333
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
<style>
component {
  MinimumWidth 230
}
</style>

actor "Platform User\n(Student / Professor / Investor)" as PlatformUser
actor "Founder" as Founder

package "Client Application (View)" as CLIENT {
  component "Web Client (Frontend, Next.js)\n\nREST calls over HTTP / JSON\n(multipart for image uploads)\nsession cookie + CSRF token" as WebClient
}

package "Backend Application" as BACKEND {
  interface "Auth API" as IAuth
  interface "Ideas API" as IIdeas
  interface "Attachments\nAPI" as IAttachments
  interface "Comments API" as IComments
  interface "Users API" as IUsers
  interface "Metrics API" as IMetrics

  component "Auth\n\nAuthController\nSecurityConfig\n(Spring Security)" <<Sprint 2>> as Auth
  component "Ideas\n\nIdeaController\nIdeaService\nIdeaRepository\n(search by tags and stage,\ncontact)" <<Sprint 2>> as Ideas
  component "Attachments\n\nAttachmentController\nAttachmentService\nAttachmentRepository" as Attachments
  component "Comments\n\nCommentController\nCommentService\nCommentRepository" as Comments
  component "Users\n\nUserController\nUserService\nUserRepository" as Users
  component "Metrics\n\nMetricsController\nMetricsService\nIdeaViewRepository\nContactClickRepository" <<new>> as Metrics

  Auth -up- IAuth
  Ideas -up- IIdeas
  Attachments -up- IAttachments
  Comments -up- IComments
  Users -up- IUsers
  Metrics -up- IMetrics
}

package "Infrastructure" as INFRA {
  database "Relational Database\n(MySQL)" as DB
  folder "Image Storage" as IMG
}

' --- client side ---
PlatformUser --> WebClient
Founder --> WebClient
WebClient ..> IAuth : login / logout
WebClient ..> IIdeas
WebClient ..> IAttachments
WebClient ..> IComments
WebClient ..> IUsers
WebClient ..> IMetrics : record view /\ncontact click,\nload dashboard

' --- dependencies between backend components (service -> repository in the MVC) ---
Auth ..> Users : find user,\ncheck password
Attachments ..> Ideas : load draft,\ncheck founder
Ideas ..> Attachments : count screenshots\nbefore publishing
Comments ..> Ideas : idea status and\nfeedback settings
Comments ..> Users : comment author
Ideas ..> Users : founder
Users ..> Ideas : saved ideas
Metrics ..> Ideas : idea exists, is PUBLISHED\nand visible; founder check
Metrics ..> Users : viewer and role

' --- infrastructure ---
Ideas --> DB : SQL
Attachments --> DB : SQL
Comments --> DB : SQL
Users --> DB : SQL
Metrics --> DB : SQL\n(idea_views,\ncontact_clicks)
Attachments --> IMG : image files

note right of Metrics
  <b>New in US 3.1 / 3.2</b>
  POST /api/ideas/{id}/views
  POST /api/ideas/{id}/contact-clicks
  GET  /api/ideas/{id}/metrics?period=
  (7d, 30d or all)
  (founder or administrator only;
  must require authentication in SecurityConfig,
  which today lets every GET /api/** through)
  A failed recording call never blocks
  the idea page.
end note

legend right
  |= Colour |= Meaning |
  |<#F1F1F1> | Sprint 1 (unchanged) |
  |<#E8F0FB> | Changed in Sprint 2, implemented |
  |<#FFF4D6> | Sprint 3, new design (US 3.1) |
endlegend

@enduml
